@startuml
title Оформление заказа: успешный сценарий Saga

actor "Покупатель" as Client
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Order Service" as Order
participant "Inventory Service" as Inventory
participant "Catalog Service" as Catalog
participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Logistics Service" as Logistics
participant "Notification Service" as Notification
participant "Seller Service" as Seller
queue "Kafka\norder-topic" as KafkaOrder
queue "Kafka\ninventory-topic" as KafkaInventory
queue "Kafka\npayment-topic" as KafkaPayment
queue "Kafka\nlogistics-topic" as KafkaLogistics
database "Order DB" as OrderDb
participant "Платёжный шлюз" as PaymentGateway
participant "Логистический провайдер" as LogisticsProvider

Client -> Gateway: POST /api/orders\nтовары, количество, адрес, доставка, оплата
Gateway -> Order: создать заказ
Order -> OrderDb: заказ, статус AWAITING_PAYMENT
Order -> KafkaOrder: OrderCreated
Order --> Gateway: 201 Created, orderId, статус «Ожидает оплаты»
Gateway --> Client: заказ создан, перейти к оплате

KafkaOrder -> Inventory: OrderCreated
Inventory -> Inventory: проверить остатки и создать резерв
Inventory -> KafkaInventory: InventoryReserved
KafkaInventory -> Catalog: InventoryReserved
Catalog -> Catalog: уменьшить доступное количество в каталоге
KafkaInventory -> Payment: InventoryReserved

Payment -> PaymentGateway: авторизация и списание средств
PaymentGateway --> Payment: успешный ответ, paymentId

Payment -> KafkaPayment: PaymentSucceeded
KafkaPayment -> Order: PaymentSucceeded
Order -> OrderDb: статус PAID
Order -> KafkaOrder: OrderStatusChanged(PAID)
Order -> KafkaOrder: DeliveryRequested
KafkaOrder -> Logistics: DeliveryRequested
Order --> Gateway: статус «Оплачен и готовится к отправке»
Gateway --> Client: статус заказа

KafkaPayment -> Seller: PaymentSucceeded
Seller -> Seller: показать заказ в кабинете продавца
KafkaPayment -> Notification: PaymentSucceeded
Notification -> Notification: отправить уведомление продавцу
Notification -> KafkaOrder: NotificationSent

Logistics -> LogisticsProvider: создать заявку на доставку
LogisticsProvider --> Logistics: trackingId, дата доставки
Logistics -> KafkaLogistics: DeliveryRegistered
KafkaLogistics -> Order: DeliveryRegistered
Order -> OrderDb: трек-номер, статус HANDED_TO_DELIVERY
Order -> KafkaOrder: OrderStatusChanged(HANDED_TO_DELIVERY)
Gateway --> Client: статус «Передан в доставку», трек-номер

LogisticsProvider -> Logistics: вебхук «заказ доставлен»
Logistics -> KafkaLogistics: DeliveryCompleted
KafkaLogistics -> Order: DeliveryCompleted
Order -> OrderDb: статус DELIVERED
Order -> KafkaOrder: OrderStatusChanged(DELIVERED)
KafkaLogistics -> Inventory: DeliveryCompleted
Inventory -> Inventory: списать резерв в продажу
Gateway --> Client: статус «Доставлен»
@enduml
